From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:46:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xgameruntime: Implement XGameRuntimeFeature.

XGameRuntimeIsFeatureAvailable() reports every feature available, as a Windows install with
Gaming Services does; interfaces this runtime does not implement fail on their own. Titles call
it often (Minecraft about 425 times a second), so the object does not log and QueryApiImpl checks
its class first. A test keeps the call under 10 us.

Ported from WineGDK (LGPL-2.1-or-later); changes are original work for macrock.

Topic: xfeature
